  "prefLabel": "Ins 4601.04 Antifraud Plans Submitted Upon Request",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 4601.04 Antifraud Plans Submitted Upon Request.\n\n(a) An insurer, if requested by the department, subject to RSA 408-D:14 and RSA 417:30, shall submit to the commissioner a detailed description of the company's antifraud plan.\n\n(b) Any antifraud plans so submitted shall be subject to review by the commissioner.\n\nSource. #10024, eff 11-14-11; ss by #13148, eff 12-28-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins4600.html"
